package: normbydate
version: 1.0
date: 11 Oct 2025
title: Normalize a variable by a baseline date (normbydate)
author: Jose Gabriel Carreno
contact: jgcarrenobustos@example.com
url: https://github.com/jgcarrenobustos/normbydate
license: MIT

description:
This package provides the `normbydate' ado command and help file. It
normalizes a variable by its value at a specified baseline date,
optionally within by-groups. See `normbydate.sthlp' for usage.

files:
  - normbydate.ado
  - normbydate.sthlp
  - test.do
  - README.md
